---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About VideoEditChoice"
	description="Learn about VideoEditChoice and our mission to help beginners choose the right video editing software."
>
	<article class="legal-page">
		<h1>About VideoEditChoice</h1>

		<section>
			<h2>Our Mission</h2>
			<p>
				VideoEditChoice exists to solve one problem: beginners choosing the wrong video editing software
				and quitting before they even start.
			</p>
			<p>
				Every day, thousands of beginners download professional video editing tools based on marketing hype
				or YouTube recommendations, only to find:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>The software is too complex for their skill level</li>
				<li>Their computer can't handle it</li>
				<li>The learning curve is steeper than expected</li>
				<li>It doesn't match their actual needs</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We cut through the noise and provide honest, practical guidance that helps beginners make informed
				decisions based on their real situation.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>What Makes Us Different</h2>
			<p>Unlike other video editing review sites, we:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Tell you who should NOT use software</strong> - Not just who should</li>
				<li><strong>Provide realistic PC requirements</strong> - Not marketing claims</li>
				<li><strong>Focus on learning curve</strong> - The hardest part for beginners</li>
				<li><strong>Give clear decisions</strong> - Not endless comparisons</li>
				<li><strong>Prioritize beginner success</strong> - Over feature lists</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Who This Site Is For</h2>
			<p>VideoEditChoice is designed for:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Complete beginners with zero video editing experience</li>
				<li>Students creating content for school or YouTube</li>
				<li>Aspiring content creators just starting out</li>
				<li>Anyone confused about which software to choose</li>
				<li>People with low-end or average computers</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				If you're already an experienced editor, our content might be too basic for you.
				We intentionally focus on helping complete beginners succeed.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Our Approach</h2>
			<p>Every article on this site follows a simple principle: <strong>honest guidance over marketing hype</strong>.</p>
			<p>We focus on:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Real-world experience, not theoretical features</li>
				<li>Actual PC performance, not minimum specs</li>
				<li>Beginner success rate, not expert opinions</li>
				<li>Clear recommendations, not endless options</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Transparency</h2>
			<p>
				Some links on this site are affiliate links, which means we may earn a commission if you make a
				purchase through them at no extra cost to you. This helps support the site.
			</p>
			<p>
				However, our recommendations are based on genuine usefulness for beginners, not commission rates.
				We recommend free software frequently because it's often the best choice for beginners.
			</p>
			<p>
				Read our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for more details.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Contact Us</h2>
			<p>
				Have questions or suggestions? Visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> to get in touch.
			</p>
		</section>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.legal-page {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.legal-page h1 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e5e5;
	}

	.legal-page section {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.legal-page h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		color: #111;
	}

	.legal-page ul {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.legal-page li {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
</style>
